{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id381533624"}, "name":{"label":"Gemmytime"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-27T01:16:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"12469709607"}, "title":{"label":"Changed my Life"}, "content":{"label":"This app truly is amazing and I never leave reviews, but felt that I really wanted to express how it truly has helped me become more organised and productive with my day. My brain gets really stressed as I lead a somewhat busy life. Having the feature to pre-plan and tick off really is so helpful. I love the unstructured thought, this is great for if you are an overthink we and constantly have new things pop up, but aren’t sure where to put them. I pair this app with One sec and Habits, which are both as equally amazing and easy to use. The subscription is worth the price!! They make it affordable for such a great quality app. I think more people need to use this app and I would not go back to not using it. So easy, simple and helpful, all of them. \n\nGreat job.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
