{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1637573123"}, "name":{"label":"Paulos Lilius"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-19T06:42:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"12438853616"}, "title":{"label":"Game changing"}, "content":{"label":"I’m generally sceptical with apps and will fully utilise trial periods to assess and evaluate… still wasn’t 100% until I’d used it for about a month and now I’m a full convert.\nThe calendar sync is faultless and really allows me to manage my time effectively and the more I use it the more uses I find.\nThere are only two apps I absolutely love on iOS, this being one of them (the other is Nebo).\nThe learning materials are also excellent and succinct.\nHighly recommended, especially if your time management is (was) as bad as mine.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
