{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1295678766"}, "name":{"label":"Hdodbdhvd"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-16T03:19:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"12426874876"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing✨"}, "content":{"label":"I have recently downloaded this app and within about 2 weeks I already have a subscription! It is amazing for students as it helps to keep my life more organised and productive. I have been remembering to do my homework and have been off my phone a lot now. My screen time was about 6 hours and now it is down to 3. Definitely recommend!✨ \n\nAs well, great pricing £15 a year is absolutely fantastic as it is not way to expensive!! \n\nDownload Structured now it will be such an upgrade to your life. TRUST me!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
