{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id918186575"}, "name":{"label":"Arsh Alam"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-22T03:31:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12341051460"}, "title":{"label":"Would be brilliant with one change"}, "content":{"label":"This app is brilliant and I use it everyday. Helps you understand how much time you have in the day, structure your day (no way right?), much easier to objectively reflect on the day at the end and almost keep you accountable by seeing what you did and didn’t tick from your activities. I would  comfortably say I’m like 2-3x more productive using it. However, the one thing I would say the app needs is to let you shift blocks of activities down as much as you want e.g. if a meeting went over by 30 and it delays everything else, it means you have to shift everything manually which is a pain. Beyond that, great app and great work developing it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
