{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id652464310"}, "name":{"label":"myreviewnameis"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-21T11:00:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12338490518"}, "title":{"label":"Unbelievably bad AI"}, "content":{"label":"The worst AI I’ve ever encountered. It deletes days by itself. It cannot restore anything. It cannot help you duplicate any days. It cannot do anything useful and will stress you out. It needs sooooo much work it’s unbelievable. They need to make these options available without the AI because it’s going to ruin everyone’s faith in what was a great app. Why can we not undo? Why can we not copy days? How is this complicated for a scheduling app?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id652464310"}, "name":{"label":"myreviewnameis"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-20T02:58:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12332994494"}, "title":{"label":"Great app - worst AI I’ve encountered"}, "content":{"label":"The app itself is fantastic. It provides a lot of flexibility and makes scheduling better in general. I love being able to choose icons and colours to be able to categorise. There is a large selection and you can see they’ve put a lot of work into it.\n\nThere are a few very clunky parts though, trying to change the time requires going through multiple menus, as do a few options. It makes everything take a lot longer. There are just too many things to click through which imo could be accomplished with a single window and not having to close 3 windows every time you make a change.\n\nAs for the AI - it might be called AI but I’ve met more intelligent 2 year olds. Basic functionality like replicating days is almost impossible. This leaves you having to completely design the same day multiple times - unless you’re ready to set everything up as a repeating task, but when is that ever a reality? If the AI cannot replicate a day in a scheduler then how much use is it really? Ask it to move something, it will screw it up. Ask it to help with any of the features that you get with the paid subscription and you will want to throw your pc out of the window. It requires a LOT of work and is nowhere near being helpful in any way.\n\nThat being said, I would, despite all of it’s shortcomings still pay for it again, as using it without the paid options isn’t quite the same.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"5"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"6"}}, 
