{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id456742329"}, "name":{"label":"Edward Bensa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-17T05:09:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12321666710"}, "title":{"label":"Excellent"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app's use of a timeline to organise tasks. A couple of features that'd be super useful would be to add durations to subtasks to \"structure\" them, and also to add labels for the different kinds of tasks.\n\nMy gripe currently is the issue of the widget glitches.\n\nKeep up the great work, though! Thank you for this super useful program!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1320737903"}, "name":{"label":"Spacexplorer11"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-15T13:42:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12315353007"}, "title":{"label":"The best app ever"}, "content":{"label":"This app, has changed my life, forever. No other app has been used for this long and this seriously like this one. It has genuinely overhauled my entire life and made 200% more productive!! I can’t believe I didn’t discover it earlier!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id211139545"}, "name":{"label":"Flowers 💐🌸🌺"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-13T16:20:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12307842458"}, "title":{"label":"Forced AI in a task app is the only downside"}, "content":{"label":"I have ADHD so I really love and have raved about this app to others for years now. I was looking into getting the lifetime version when they updated the app to have an AI tab. I really appreciate that the app doesn’t just give your data to OpenAi without your permission! But I wish they would make the AI tab itself optional, as it’s become pretty obstructive to the app experience, despite being useless to those that opt out of sharing their data. (I imagine adding “removing the tab” to customisation would be fairly simple, so fingers crossed they do this and I can feel comfortable buying the lifetime version!)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
