{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id245788080"}, "name":{"label":"Studentuser1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-10T14:06:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12295754046"}, "title":{"label":"I LOVE ITTTTTTTTT!!!!"}, "content":{"label":"IVE BEEN LOOKING FOR THESE TYPE OF APPS FOR AGES, AND THIS WAS BEYOND MY EXPECTATIONS!!! IT IS LINKED WITH ONE SEC TOO, SOOOOO USEFUL! THIS IS FROM AN 11 YEAR OLD, THIS IS THE BEST AND I ALWAYS STAY ON TRACK WITH MY HOMEWORK NOW THANKS TO THIS!!!! YOU CAN DECORATE IT HOWEVER YOU LIKE, ITS THE BESTT! THANK YOU SO MUCHHHHH STRUCTURED! U SAVED MY LIFE", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1638720944"}, "name":{"label":"Notsirt.mi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-10T06:58:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12294424068"}, "title":{"label":"Terrible update"}, "content":{"label":"App crashes when the date on the top left is pressed, cannot jump to a specific date without scrolling, whole-day events aren’t even shown under the dates anymore, so you’ll have to click on the actual date to see if you have something. This update is literally a huge step back from what it was. If it doesn’t change back, or solve these problems that other people are also facing, then refund us the money.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id633537762"}, "name":{"label":"Don’t want it any more"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-10T03:33:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12293747983"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed"}, "content":{"label":"I was using this app in the past and it was very good. Then I cancelled my subscription and after a while I decided to go to it again. Paid for subscription and now it’s not working properly. When I want to edit something the app freeze. When I delete my first app it said it will delete all data but now the same data appears on my app and I can’t edit anything because app freeze. So paid for subscription but it’s useless now.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id913687094"}, "name":{"label":"hdjsjdhdhffbxfh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-07T02:09:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12281172261"}, "title":{"label":"Great up until latest update"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used structured for years now, I pay annually for it cause it was that great. This latest update is TERRIBLE! I cannot access monthly view - my app just crashes, cannot access the weekly view - my app just crashes. I have to physically scroll along until I get to the month that I want, and even when I get to it it doesn’t show that I have tasks that day that I KNOW I had put up. The AI feature is useless I don’t know why someone would need an AI assistant for a calendar app?… \n\nPLEASE structured devs go back to before the “biggest update”, you ruined the app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
